   "source": [
    "Original data labelling guide for VandenBerg et al. (2013).\n",
    "- Cluster_ID: Identifier of the globular cluster\n",
    "- FeH: Metallicity, [Fe/H] (dex), on the Carretta et al. (2009) scale\n",
    "- Age: Absolute age (Gyr)\n",
    "- Age_err: Uncertainty in the age (Gyr)\n",
    "- HBtype: Horizontal branch morphology index, from -1 (red HB) to +1 (blue HB)\n",
    "- R_G: Galactocentric distance (kpc)\n",
    "- M_V: Absolute visual magnitude"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "cf5fd2a0",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Original data labelling guide for Krause et al. (2016).\n",
    "- Age_Krause: Age (Gyr), compiled from the literature. No uncertainty is given.\n",
    "- FeH_Krause: Metallicity, [Fe/H] (dex)\n",
    "- Mstar: Stellar mass ($10^5 M_\\odot$)\n",
    "- rh: Half-mass radius (pc)\n",
    "- C5: Compactness, $M_*/r_h$ ($10^5 M_\\odot$/pc)"
   ]
